WEBVTT

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.120
What is the relationship between Lucia and me?

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.000
I guess it's about time I should move back here.

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.820
Mikaru's condition has improved.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:06.770
If I stay here, I feel like I can remember what I forgot.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.490
The Heart Within the Heart

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.800
Uhh, Rihito-san.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:21.760
Kaito-kun.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.210
I want to talk to you about something.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.780
Okay. What is it?

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.110
Um...

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.710
Hey, Onii-sama.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:33.700
Is it okay if Kaito and I go to your concert tomorrow?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.450
Of course. You're more than welcome.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.950
Hey, Kaito. Want to go?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:39.960
O-Okay.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.920
Oh yeah. On my way home, I ran into Lucia-chan and her friends.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:49.130
I gave them tickets to the concert, so you might run into them at the performance hall.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.850
Eh? Lucia?

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.340
Lucia-chan is going, too?

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.470
It won't be just me and Kaito?

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.800
So, what did you want to talk to me about, Kaito-kun?

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:11.810
Ever since you rescued me in Hawaii, you've gone to great lengths to take care of me.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.740
I figure that I shouldn't continue to simply live off your generosity.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.010
So I think I should move back to my own place.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.420
I don't really mind that... but did something happen, Kaito-kun?

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.140
Oh no. Nothing happened.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.350
But I can't just stay like this.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:42.650
I don't think my missing memories will return easily.

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.290
I see.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:47.830
After hearing you say that, I won't stop you.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:53.420
Kaito-kun is leaving this house and leaving me all alone?

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.610
One, two, three, four!

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.840
Two, two, three, four!

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:16.430
Spin! Then smile!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:19.000
Three, two, three, four!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.960
Four, two, three, four!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:26.370
Alala-chan, it must be difficult for you to always be practicing.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:30.380
It is! I constantly remind myself that I have to work hard and keep smiling.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.260
The idol world is harsh, so I have to do this.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.990
I see.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:41.030
I think it's about time the Mermaid Ladies succumbed to my sincere love.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.120
Hey, Sister Mimi.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.540
All of Mikeru-sama's servants are weirdos.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.400
How true. They don't seem to be worth a damn.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:57.410
Okay! Everyone, can I have your attention!

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.380
Mikeru-sama will be here soon!

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.200
My loyal servants.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:07.650
From now on, things will not be so carefree.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:11.300
The Great One has waited for us long enough.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.310
I will bestow this onto you.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:22.920
These spheres were extracted from the heart shards of the Orange Pearl Mermaid Princess, Seira.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.440
Please use them as you wish in accordance with your abilities.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:35.740
So, who's going to use the power that Mikeru-sama has given first?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.920
Mikeru-sama!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.550
We will, of course! Leave it to us.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.650
Geez, both of you are too stupid to do anything.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:49.420
That's right. How many chances have you two had already but came away empty-handed?

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:51.490
Hmph!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.160
Mikeru-sama, we've come up with a really good plan.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.430
Please look at this.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:00.660
There will be a concert at this venue tomorrow.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:04.450
We've carefully examined the tendencies of the Mermaid Princesses.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.780
When such an event is held, they will definitely show up in such a place.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.160
If we lay our nets in this area...

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:15.510
That is good.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:19.590
Sheshe. Mimi. You will be responsible for this next attack.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.010
Everyone else will be supporting the Black Beauty Sisters.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.770
Oh my.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.820
You said "everyone?"

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.300
The Great One will be watching your progress.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.800
Understood, Mikeru-sama.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:42.550
Even though it does not entirely satisfy my heart, I will obey the order from you and your white wings.

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:50.620
I will support the Black Beauty Sisters and capture the Mermaid Ladies as they appear at the concert.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.900
You will destroy the entire concert hall!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:03.420
Instead of capturing them, we're going to bury the Mermaid Ladies in the rubble?

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:05.040
You will completely annihilate them!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:10.670
Do you understand Mikeru-sama's orders?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:27.500
This is definitely Rihito-san's concert. There are so many people!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:35.820
If we could even get one hundredth of the people here to come to the Pearl Piari, Nikora-san would be pleased.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.390
L-Lucia! Let's hurry and get to our seats.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:49.400
Hey everyone! Rihito-san told me you were coming and asked that I meet you all here.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:54.730
No matter how you look at it, Kaito and Mikaru make a good couple.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.650
This time, Mikeru-sama's order...

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.300
...is to destroy this concert hall!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:09.140
He's a lot more daring than usual. How exciting!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.100
Everyone, get {your butts }to your designated areas.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.390
How true.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.880
Those are Mikeru-sama's orders.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.770
We'll help you today.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.210
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.260
Are you okay?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:39.430
I'm fine. Nothing's wrong.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.750
There's still some time before it starts, right?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.570
I'll go find something to drink. I'm thirsty.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.050
This isn't going to work. This will just make Hanon and Rina worry more about me.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.010
I need to just endure it for now.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:54.520
Lucia.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.010
K-Kaito!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:02.410
I've decided to leave Rihito-san's house and move back into my own place.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.860
Why are you telling this to me specifically?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.120
I don't know.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.040
But I feel that I had to tell you this now.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.200
Kaito.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:14.740
So, see you later.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.330
Kaito.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:54.030
So, shall we begin, Sister Mimi?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.720
Yeah, Sister Sheshe.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:57.800
It's Show Time!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.110
Huh?

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.150
What's that?

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:10.200
I have a bad feeling.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.560
Is everyone okay?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.500
I feel like something's wrong.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.460
Yeah. To tell you the truth, I feel that way, too.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.060
Eh? Everyone's feeling it?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:54.540
I've got this bad feeling...

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.740
Mikaru, what's wrong?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.960
Are you okay, Mikaru!?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.440
What's with all the racket?

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.010
It's annoying! Stop it this instant!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:31.920
Sister Sheshe, this is weird! It should have been completely demolished.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.390
Why hasn't it been destroyed?

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.580
Why is it still standing?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.840
Why?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:38.230
How true!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:42.330
So this was the plan of the Black Beauty Sisters.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.110
This plan never had much{ of any} substance.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.800
Useless idiots!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.060
We're just here to help.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.590
That's enough for now!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.700
Let's go back.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:51.660
Let's go back!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:52.970
Let's go.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.610
We'll see you later!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:01.100
This is the failure of the ones planning this attack.

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.400
It doesn't have to do with me, so I'm heading back.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.250
I'm going on ahead!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.250
It's an earthquake!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.550
It's dangerous here!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.930
Run!

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.620
Hurry! The ceiling is about to cave in!

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.470
Don't push! Don't push!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.630
We need to get out of here.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:32.430
Agreed.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:35.490
Kaito!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.550
Hang in there, Mikaru.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:43.580
Kaito.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.030
Lucia.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.630
You're in the way!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:48.510
Get out of my way!

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:49.780
Kaito!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.630
Lucia!

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:51.830
Hurry and get out of here!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.230
Huh?

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.090
That shadow was...

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.190
There's no escape!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.720
Next is a pressure attack that will cause this concert hall to collapse!

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.990
We're not going to let you do that!

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.040
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.820
Green Pearl Voice!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:20.010
Look! I knew it! The Mermaid Princesses!

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:24.770
We'll crush you and everyone else in this concert hall.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.700
Huh? Everyone escaped...

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.280
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:49.170
What a pity. Everyone got out.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:54.010
Hmph! Even if it's just you lot, we'll still bury you in the rubble of this concert hall!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:57.030
We're going to use this special power given to us by Mikeru-sama!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:58.980
What!?

00:15:58.980 --> 00:15:59.960
That light is...

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:04.100
Huh?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.460
Where are we?

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.630
What kind of a dimension is this?

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:12.150
This is a dimension we created using Mikeru-sama's power.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.530
In here, our power is doubled.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.510
Eh!? What's going on?

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.890
It's Show Time!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.320
Lucia. Hanon. Rina.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:03.640
Seira!

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:07.290
Hang in there! You can't just give up like that.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:13.490
Lucia, weren't you going to teach me how wonderful love is?

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:20.910
Right now, I don't have the strength to show you how wonderful it can be.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:25.340
Aqua Regina-sama, please protect Lucia and the others.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.540
Aqua Regina-sama!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:37.450
The songs that you sing express the truth about love.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.270
Love can definitely be conveyed.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:43.600
To love someone is a wonderful thing.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.020
Aqua Regina-sama.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.670
I shall bestow upon all of you a new song.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.420
What's that light?

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:56.620
How true!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.530
Here we go, Black Beauty Sisters!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.280
Listen to our new song of love!

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:02.910
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.650
Not another new song!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.140
How many damn songs do they have?

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:00.570
We only have two!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:19.120
Love Shower Pitch!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.260
How about an encore?

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:25.810
Dammit!

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.020
Where's Kaito?

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:43.000
Kaito, you'll protect me.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:47.010
No matter what, you'll always protect me.

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:48.610
Mikaru...

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.310
L-Lucia.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:55.910
Kaito.

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:58.460
Lucia...

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:02.470
Kaito!

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.950
Kaito, let's go home.

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:09.630
Okay.

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:54.610
Lucia-chan, you seem really sad.

00:23:55.020 --> 00:23:58.960
When you're sad, it's better to cry it out.

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:01.800
Rihito-san, if you say that out of the blue...

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:05.700
If you treat me with such kind words, I...

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:10.010
Lucia-chan, go ahead and cry on me.

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:13.230
Cry until your tears stop and your eyes are as clear as the sky.

00:24:13.230 --> 00:24:16.360
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:16.360 --> 00:24:17.900
The Thing I Want.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:19.880
Rihito-san, I...
